# SQLite write-ahead-log sidecars. These appear as soon as a database is opened in WAL mode and
# vanish when it is checkpointed, so they are transient by nature. Committing one without its
# sibling — or without a checkpoint — can capture a database that is missing recent commits.
webapi/Data/databases/*.db-wal
webapi/Data/databases/*.db-shm
